    title: 'Paschim Vihar carries a genuinely distinct economy: a trading-family business culture',
    body: "Paschim Vihar sits close to Rajouri Garden's well-known furniture and fashion wholesale-and-retail market, and the area itself carries a strong small-business and trading-family culture, common among many West Delhi neighbourhoods with a similar community background. Peeragarhi's smaller-scale manufacturing and trading units add a further layer to this base. That creates a specific career fork a generic Delhi guidance page never addresses: whether to build formally toward retail-management, design, or e-commerce skill on top of a family trading business, or move toward a different skill path while the business continues in the background.",
