  {
    title: 'Formal retail and e-commerce skill beats informal trade experience alone',
    body: "A career built around a Paschim Vihar family trading business still benefits from real retail-management, merchandising, or e-commerce skill - not just years of informal exposure. Building a genuine skill and certification layer on top of family trade knowledge, rather than assuming familiarity is enough on its own, is what actually moves someone toward earlier financial freedom from here.",
  },
];

const tradingFamilySummaryItems = [
  {
    title: 'This trading-family culture is a real, specific local factor',
