    title: 'You can start from home, the family shop, or between training sessions',
    body: 'Career counselling is available online in Paschim Vihar and across India. That means the decision does not have to wait for a nearby office or one local slot opening up. The useful filter is whether the guidance improves the next move enough to matter.',
