  {
    title: 'Online guidance can sit alongside family conversations about trade or defence-services plans, not compete with them',
    body: 'When a family trading business or a defence-services preparation plan is part of the picture, the harder conversations often need to include family. Online sessions make it easier to include that context and join from wherever you already are.',
