    title: 'The stronger comparison is not nearby versus far away - it is generic versus genuinely useful',
    body: "A nearby or well-known option can still leave you with generic advice that ignores Paschim Vihar's specific trading-family or defence-services context. The better filter is whether the guidance gives you stronger skill direction, proof-of-work thinking, and a more practical next step.",
  },
];

