    title: 'Check whether a family trading business is treated as an asset, not dismissed',
    body: 'A family retail or trading business is a real starting asset, not a problem to escape by default. Better guidance should show what formalising it with retail-management or e-commerce skill can look like, alongside the option to build a different skill path.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Check whether a defence-services attempt gets an honest, structured answer',
